  "category": "term",
  "note": "Quickly's malapropisms \"honeysuckle\"/\"honeyseed\" (for homicidal) were silently corrected, losing the comic mistake the play note says to keep.",
  "replacement": "HOSTESS. Throw me in the gutter? I'll throw you in the gutter. Will you, will you, you bastard rogue? Murder, murder! Oh, you honeysuckle villain, will you kill God's officers and the King's? Oh, you honeyseed rogue, you're a honeyseed, a man-killer and a woman-killer."
