 {
  "coord": "5:5",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "term",
  "note": "\"one for superfluity\" rendered as \"one for show\", which is not what the source says.",
  "replacement": "PRINCE. Then my appetite probably wasn't princely in its making, because I really do remember the poor creature small beer. But these humble thoughts make me sick of my own greatness. What a disgrace it is for me to remember your name! Or to know your face tomorrow! Or to notice how many pairs of silk stockings you own — these, and the peach-colored ones you used to have! Or to keep a list of your shirts, one spare and another for use! But the tennis-court keeper knows that better than I do. It's a low ebb of linen with you when you aren't playing racket there, as you haven't for a good while, because the rest of your low countries have managed to eat up your Holland cloth. And God knows whether the ones who squall out of the ruins of your linen will inherit his kingdom. But the midwives say the children aren't to blame. That's how the world grows, and families get mightily strengthened."
 },
