 {
  "coord": "7:50",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "term",
  "note": "\"cuttle\" (a cutting bully/knife-man) wrongly rendered as the sea creature \"cuttlefish\".",
  "replacement": "DOLL. Get away, you cutpurse rascal, you filthy bung, get away! By this wine, I'll thrust my knife into your moldy jaws if you play the saucy cutthroat with me. Get away, you bottle-ale rascal, you stale basket-hilted juggler! Since when, I ask you, sir? God's light, with two ribbons on your shoulder? Some nerve!"
